notes.content:
The Ukrainian Games Festival 2025 has officially started, and Hell Of War is taking part! 🇺🇦
This is our first time participating in such a major Steam event, making it a very special moment for us.

For the festival, we’ve prepared a major update to the game’s Steam page:
• 🎬 A brand new, more dynamic trailer with a focus on key mechanics;
• 📸 New in-game screenshots;
• 📝 An updated description that better reflects the essence of the game.
[hr][/hr]🔧 What’s currently in development?
Alongside the festival, we are working on:
• 🔧 Improving AI and tactical gameplay;
• 🗺️ Creating new maps;
• 🔫 Adding new weapons;
• ⚙️ Optimizing code and graphics for better performance on lower-end PCs;
• 🧪 Preparing for Closed Testing, planned for this autumn.

📢 Important: Recruitment for the test will be announced exclusively in our Discord — join us so you don’t miss it!

🔗 Discord
